# Accepted Slack operation failure contract, current47-vector scope

Main accepted the bounded server-only context `slackOperationFailure = { reason, providerFailure }` after reviewing the existing AppError extension and safe action/callback/disconnect/public result boundaries. This is the current proposal/decision record. The original18-case proposal and16RED/2controls receipt remain historical, without being rewritten or counted as47 executions.

The current47 independently named vectors comprise5 explicit rejections,15 HTTP429 retry hints,12 uncertain-outcome cases,12 fallback cases,1 unusable successful OAuth candidate and2 revoke success controls. The actual baseline is45 assertion RED and2 passing controls, zero setup failures. The strengthened baseline moves18 body-consumption assertions ahead of classification failures; all18 pass. After implementation and the small complexity extraction, all47 classification vectors plus46 existing affected regressions pass,93 tests across5 files.

Use existing finite Reason and ProviderFailure shapes. Preserve legacy public IDs/messages/signatures and the complete read branch/slackReadFailure detail. Build context from finite values, without provider spreads, raw codes/messages/bodies, credentials, URLs, headers, transport errors or parser causes. Unknown/partial mutations retain unknown effects and never imply a safe automatic retry. HTTP429 retains only bounded integer Retry-After seconds1 through86400, normalized to milliseconds;429/503 bodies are not parsed. Underscoped successful OAuth candidates retain unknown effects because remote credentials may already exist.

The mutating read-suite companion now asserts absence of slackReadFailure and presence of the exact transient_outage/unavailable/unknown operation detail. All previous revoke successes remain: revoked:true, token_revoked, token_expired and account_inactive. The real-PG native6 confirmation receipt stays tied to its frozen2fe source. Current classifier source8585 has its own93 unit and30 distinct registry checks; Main's configured static/current-inventory/exact-CI qualification remains pending.

No new public DTO, UI, health persistence, automatic retry, DDL, provider resource or whole CONN-014 acceptance is added by this decision. The current source and check review is SOURCE-REVIEW.md; the former proposal is ../operation-definitions/CONTRACT-PROPOSAL.md, historical only.
